{{Classic Era}}
'''Permafrost Keep''' is an ancient castle buried in the glacial flow that is slowly claiming the northlands of Norrath. Most of the castle lies in ruins, and what is left consists of excavated areas of the old castle and a warren of caves dug out by the goblins who serve their dragon master.

